# Read by `next build`. metadataBase in src/app/layout.tsx falls back through
# Netlify's URL variable, then this, then http://localhost:3010 — and on the
# current host nothing sets the first one, so without this the build bakes a
# localhost og:image into the shipped HTML and every share preview dies.
#
# Public and non-secret: it is the site's own address, and it is inlined into
# the client bundle by design. Committed for exactly that reason, which is why
# .gitignore carries an explicit exception for it.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://thevirofficial.com
